@{
    Layout = "~/Views/Instruction/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}
<div class="instruction-content">
    <ul>
        <li>% Max Downline: the maximum position taking which will be given to an agent. It
            is set by direct upline agent.</li>
        <li>% Min Downline: the minimum position taking which an agent and its down-line agents
            must cover. It is set by direct upline agent.</li>
        <li>[x - y]: input range. If K is the entered amount, then K must be: x &#60;&#61; K &#60;&#61; y.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        <span class="note">Note:</span> only allow two numbers after the decimal point.
        For instance, 10.25 is a valid input, but 10.555 is not.
    </p>
</div>